{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embrace the dark arts and battle for supremacy in Lich Lords, an action RPG roguelike that blends intense hack \u2018n\u2019 slash combat with RPG elements and character customization. Create a unique Lich and explore ever-changing dungeons, where you must outlast opposing rival Liches and ruthless monsters to claim the title of Lich Lord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Roguelike Challenge \u2013 Procedurally generated dungeons ensure every run is unique. Defeat your foes or perish and start anew!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brutal Combat \u2013 Choose from a variety of classes, wield devastating weapons, and master powerful spells to conquer your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless Loot \u2013 Collect and customize weapons, armor, and magical relics with dynamic modifiers that create limitless combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Online Play \u2013 Invade other players' worlds for PvP duels or team up for cooperative dungeon crawling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep Exploration \u2013 Uncover the secrets of the ever-shifting labyrinths, where danger lurks around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only one Lich can reign supreme. Will it be you?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555440?t=1742494509","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555440?t=1742494509","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555440/f63cfb97a70452b9adbfc2054e8cf9a93e31528e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742494509","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555440/f63cfb97a70452b9adbfc2054e8cf9a93e31528e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742494509","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embrace the dark arts and battle for supremacy in Lich Lords, an action RPG roguelike that blends intense hack \u2018n\u2019 slash combat with RPG elements and character customization. Create a unique Lich and explore ever-changing dungeons, where you must outlast opposing rival Liches and ruthless monsters to claim the title of Lich Lord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Roguelike Challenge \u2013 Procedurally generated dungeons ensure every run is unique. Defeat your foes or perish and start anew!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brutal Combat \u2013 Choose from a variety of classes, wield devastating weapons, and master powerful spells to conquer your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless Loot \u2013 Collect and customize weapons, armor, and magical relics with dynamic modifiers that create limitless combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Online Play \u2013 Invade other players' worlds for PvP duels or team up for cooperative dungeon crawling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep Exploration \u2013 Uncover the secrets of the ever-shifting labyrinths, where danger lurks around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only one Lich can reign supreme. Will it be you?</p>","developers":["RE:CODE"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555440/header.jpg?t=17